# Product Warranty Claim Processing Platform

## Overview

The Product Warranty Claim Processing Platform is a web-based application designed to simplify and automate the product warranty claim process. It enables customers to register products, submit warranty claims, upload invoices, and track claim status online. Administrators can verify claims, manage warranty records, assign service centers, and monitor the complete claim lifecycle.

---

## Problem Statement

Traditional warranty claim processes are mostly manual, time-consuming, and lack transparency. Customers often lose invoices, face delays in claim approvals, and have difficulty tracking claim status. This platform provides a centralized and automated solution to improve efficiency and customer experience.

---

## Features

- User Authentication (JWT)
- Role-Based Access Control (Customer, Admin, Service Center)
- Product Registration
- Warranty Verification
- Warranty Claim Submission
- Invoice Upload
- Claim Status Tracking
- Admin Dashboard
- Service Center Management
- Notifications
- Reports and Analytics

